><mn>5</mn></menclose></mstyle></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only\". </p>\n</div></div>",
